 "prompt": "You are answering a biomedical research question using the abstract below.\n\nAbstract:\n\"\"\"\nBACKGROUND: Multiple sclerosis (MS) is an immune-mediated inflammatory demyelinating disease of uncertain etiology. Although the mechanisms of inducting autoimmunity by some of the infectious agents have been investigated, there is not yet enough research on streptococcal infections.MATERIAL/\n\nMETHODS: To understand the effect of past group A streptococcal infection on MS, antistreptolysin O (ASO) and antideoxyribonuclease B (ADNase B) were measured in 21 patients with relapsing-remitting MS and 21 healthy blood donors by nephelometric assay.\n\nRESULTS: ADNase B levels in the patients with MS were found to be significantly higher than in the controls (p<0.001); however, ASO levels were similar in both groups.\n\"\"\"\n\nQuestion: Is there any relationship between streptococcal infection and multiple sclerosis?\n\nAnswer \"yes\", \"no\", or \"maybe\", and give your confidence from 0 to 100 that your answer is correct. Also copy, word for word, one to three sentences from the abstract that support your answer.\n\nRespond with only a JSON object and no other text, in exactly this format:\n{\"answer\": \"yes\" or \"no\" or \"maybe\", \"confidence\": integer from 0 to 100, \"quotes\": [\"exact sentence copied from the abstract\", ...]}",
